No law text is published. This repository holds metadata only.

Catalogue entries (bill number, title, Royal Assent date) are facts recorded by the Legislative Assembly of
New Brunswick (https://www.legnb.ca), whose Status of Legislation states: "Information on this site has been
posted with the intent that it be readily available for personal and public non-commercial use and may be
reproduced in part or in whole, and by any means, without charge or further permission." No text of the
bills is reproduced.

The "legal-system" facts come from Wikidata (https://www.wikidata.org), released under CC0 1.0.

The Acts and Regulations of New Brunswick (https://laws.gnb.ca) are not copied here.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
